  "designNotes": "The Creative template merges the best of visual portfolio and design process storytelling. Near-black backgrounds create a gallery void that lets visual work breathe, while the hot pink / electric blue / neon yellow triad delivers the visual punch that stops a scroll. The animated gradient hero name is the signature: an infinitely cycling Syne 800-weight headline. The masonry gallery grid is the centrepiece for showcasing design and photography work, with category filtering and a design process timeline for UX/brand professionals."
